{"product_id":"1000-more-graphic-elements-2","title":"1000 More Graphic Elements: 2","description":"\u003cp\u003e1000 More Graphic Elements is the follow-up to the extremely successful 1000 Graphic Elements, published in 2004. This edition features 1000 new unique graphic embellishments across all kinds of projects, from books to brochures, invitations to calendars to annual reports. It is often the smallest detail that can turn a project from ordinary to spectacular. Inspiration will be at your fingertips with examples of specialty processes such as diecutting and embossing, unique materials, fasteners, specialty inks, binders and more. \u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Grant Design Collaborative\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781592535514\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 320\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 226 x 231\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Book Loop Book.in","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41750679453849,"sku":"3RF9781592535514","price":40.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/products\/1000-more-graphic-elements-2-433812.jpg?v=1694789504","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/1000-more-graphic-elements-2","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}